  "description": "[Ultra-High Power] The Wild Buffaloelectric skateboard has a 2800W*2 high torque BLDC motor that enables it to travel at a top speed of 31 MPH and easily ascend inclination slopes of 46%. The 1134Wh battery gives the skateboard electric longboard a range of 50 miles after a full charge takes 3 hours using a 4.5A charger. This longboard will provide you with plenty of amusement.\n\n[Sturdy & Strong] This Motor-Boyelectric skateboard has a board that is 38.6 inches long, 2 ply of fiberglass, and weighs 33 lbs, giving it a strong rebound. If you are the type of rider that enjoys extra bounce, this would be the ideal board for you.\n\n[Stable & Safe] The RKP truck used by the Motor-Boyskateboard is reliable and allows for quick turns while maintaining stability and smoothness even at higher speeds. 440 lbs is the maximum load capacity, and the 90mm shockproof polyurethane road wheels will provide you with a solid and comfortable glide.\n\nPackage\nN.W.\n\nG.W.",
